/div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm offset-2/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nUsing a combination of high-fidelity pre-rendered visuals and an embedded interactive WebGL model, we gave users a taste of the quality they can expect from Letter’s solid aluminium bank card.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/df4df4ffbcef.m4v\" dom2webgl=\"image1098\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/6d5a221a8950.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1301\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/efd8f7bf1635.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/586109980717.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1299\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm mb-1@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nA visual breakdown\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nWhen it came to creating the interactive crystal elements for the website, we had a choice to make. Using live 3D models and textures in WebGL would have created a more interactive experience, but the visuals would have been limited by performance constraints. As aesthetics were central to the brand’s ethos, we opted for a pre-rendered image sequence tied to scroll. This option allowed us to create a high-fidelity visual while retaining an element of user interaction.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/1efaae4c834d.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1303\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image11896aaa795870417\" src=\"/media/091742d622fb.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm mb-1@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nBrand visuals  \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nBuilding on the high-end aesthetic established on the website, we created beautiful 3D static and motion assets for use across marketing collateral and beyond.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/25f60dfed083.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image600\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image13076aaa7958755aa\" src=\"/media/ab481b108c1a.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image11716aaa795879620\" src=\"/media/0cdad2c17cd4.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image12006aaa79587d1d6\" src=\"/media/06f1d638fcf1.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/5f8972e8b870.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm | js-awards\">\n<div class=\"container my-5 d-block d-flex@sm my-10@md overflow-hidden\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-2/5@sm pr-0 pr-3@sm relative\">\n<h2 class=\"t-lh-1.1\">\n<span class=\"pl-0.25 t-serif t-italic t-500 t-2 t-3@sm\">Awards &amp; <br/></span>\n<span class=\"t-sans t-500 t-2 t-3@sm\">Recognition</span